OL,3,AFaisal Islam: What surprise praise for
OL,4,AUK economy tells us about the Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Get your fiscal health in order," is a
OL,7,Fkey message at the International
OL,8,FMonetary Fund's (IMF) annual meeting
OL,9,Fhere in Thailand.
OL,11,FThe IMF is worried about the debts of
OL,12,Fthe world's biggest economies. It is
OL,13,Fdoing its job as a watchdog, looking
OL,14,Ffor and warning about financial
OL,15,Fvulnerabilities.
OL,17,FIn the meantime, the finance ministers
OL,18,Fof former crisis countries are boasting
OL,19,Fabout how little their borrowing costs
OL,20,Fhave gone up, compared to the world's
OL,21,Fbiggest economies, such as the US.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
