OL,3,AFaisal Islam: What surprise praise for
OL,4,AUK economy tells us about the Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn three occasions in the past 24
OL,7,Fhours, top IMF officials have praised
OL,8,Fthe UK's plans to reduce its annual
OL,9,Flevels of borrowing, bucking the trend
OL,10,Fof the rest of the G7 group of
OL,11,Fcountries, which includes Canada,
OL,12,FFrance, Germany, Italy, Japan and the
OL,13,FUS.
